::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.950
I grabbed hold, digging in my claws
te ni totte tsume o tateta

3
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.380
but the future
sono mirai wa

4
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:34.600
blurred together, colors running
nijimu iro ni kasunde mieta

5
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:41.200
A red that can swallow even summer's hues
natsu no iro mo nuritsubusu you na aka ni

6
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:47.920
bokura no koe kakikesareteiku you de
now attempts to blot out our voices

7
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:54.660
Move those halting feet of yours
tachidomaru sono ashi o fumidasou ze

8
00:00:54.660 --> 00:01:01.300
Don't let stand the lies for show
misekake no uso yarisugosu yori

9
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:07.550
I'll give up countless mornings for my vows
nandome no asa chikai to hikikaeru yo

10
00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:16.100
For the dream that we shared
bokura ga miteita yume

11
00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.250
We do not have time, Saturn!

12
00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:34.960
Vegapunk must not...

13
00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.430
...be given license to speak!

14
00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.180
I shall make the summons.

15
00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:51.840
<b>Starfall</b>

16
00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.620
What in tarnation is that?!

17
00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:11.960
That’s...

18
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.800
...what happened
when St. Saturn made landfall earlier!

19
00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.190
Who-ho-hoa there!

20
00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.470
That’s where Stella and the others are!

21
00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.680
I’m worried about them!

22
00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.640
Better get in touch with Nami-san’s group!

23
00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.650
<b>Holy Land
Mary Geoise</b>

24
00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.560
Stella, what is that?

25
00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.570
The dream of all mankind,
 Vega Coffee!

26
00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:19.490
Just drop a tiny speck
 of this stuff in some water...

27
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:22.410
...and you’ve got nice,
 hot coffee in an instant!

28
00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.450
How many minutes do we have?

29
00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:29.540
We aren’t on a strict timer per se...

30
00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.910
Let’s wait seven minutes or so,
 and then we’ll begin.

31
00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.460
Though to be fair,
 even if there is anyone wanting to intercept,

32
00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.420
they won’t be within range to do so.

33
00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.320
There’re five monsters now?!

34
00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.080
〝Sandworm〟

35
00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.540
〝Bakotsu〟

36
00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.000
〝Fengxi〟

37
00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.460
〝Itsumade〟

38
00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.920
〝Gyuki〟

39
00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:16.100
<b>Highest Authority
of the World Government</b>

40
00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.300
What?! The Pacifista...!

41
00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.310
It’s been downed?!

42
00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.060
I saw something!

43
00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.410
There’s something
racing along the shore!

44
00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.410
A giant horse?

45
00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.040
It vanished!

46
00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:33.550
The Pacifistas over here
 are no longer functioning!

47
00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:34.720
Same here!

48
00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:35.810
They’re being cut down?

49
00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:38.180
No, seems like they’re partially frozen!

50
00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:45.020
Hello?!
Nami-san, Robin-chan, et cetera!

51
00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.400
It’s kinda hard to explain
what’s going on down here...

52
00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:59.370
But basically, time’s up!
Get out of there any way you can!

53
00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.330
Huh? Why?!
 Sanji-kun, what do you mean?!

54
00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.000
Reporting in!

55
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:11.220
Due to frozen cerebral circuits,
the downed Pacifistas are...

56
00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:13.220
...temporarily disabled!

57
00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.720
Someone did that for us?!

58
00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:18.560
Now we don’t have to
waste strength on a lose-lose battle!

59
00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:21.850
We have an opening!
Kill Bonney now!

60
00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.860
Bonney and the Straw Hats
are at the northeast shore!

61
00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.110
Half of the Pacifistas
are already disabled!

62
00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.900
Definitely not the enemy’s doing!

63
00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.570
Run fast and run away!

64
00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.450
A really freaky monster’s
flying up towards you!

65
00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.510
Just get out of there, now!

66
00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:06.560
Hup!

67
00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.040
Uhh? It’s gone.

68
00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.870
It dug into the ground?!

69
00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:24.960
Is it an earthworm?!

70
00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.920
Sanji! This is Usopp!

71
00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.880
Brook and Lilith are here.

72
00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:15.840
The ship, though...

73
00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.180
Well, it was a close call,
but it’s fine.

74
00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.720
There! We’ve arrived safe and sound,
just as I said we would.

75
00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:27.270
Don’t take credit!
It stopped thanks to Usopp!

76
00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.110
Well, we wish we could
just get outta here right now,

77
00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.190
but Zoro and Jinbe aren’t back yet!

78
00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:36.900
Damn that mosshead! He’s still fighting?!
What a pain in the ass!

79
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.990
Jinbe!
What’s going on over there?!

80
00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.200
I understand the urgency.

81
00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:46.080
Whether they’ve finished fighting or not,
I’m dragging Zoro back with me!

82
00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.540
Thanks, Jinbe! Sounds good!

83
00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:19.610
You sense that Haki, too?
Almost makes you want to stop and look.

84
00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.320
Yeah, it’s all over the island...

85
00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.460
I see him!

86
00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:36.510
And he’s still fighting!

87
00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:40.340
That moron mosshead,
 putting all of us in danger!

88
00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.800
He’s a liability!

89
00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.530
Hand Gun:

90
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.750
Spots!

91
00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.270
Three-Sword Style:

92
00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.360
Huhuva...

93
00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.150
...Spot Hunt!

94
00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.770
You see that?

95
00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:19.900
I saw! A familiar sight!

96
00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:24.070
A man ill-suited for dark places!

97
00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.360
Let’s go!

98
00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.590
Sun Saw!

99
00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.150
Close call!

100
00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.440
Awhuuuh?!

101
00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.900
Hey, if it ain’t the ol’ Giant guys!

102
00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.110
It’s been too long, Straw Hat!

103
00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.740
We just couldn’t wait!
We had to see you again!

104
00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.620
Beep-bup-beep, bup-bip-bop, beep-bup-beep, bup-bip-bop
Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo piipapii papipo, piipapii

105
00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:27.840
Beep-bup-beep, bup-bip-bop beep-beep-beep-bup-bop
Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo piipii pipopii, pipopiipii

106
00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:32.050
Beep-bup-beep, bup-bip-bop, beep-bup-beep, bup-bip-bop
Piipapii papipo, piipapii papipo piipapii papipo, piipapii

107
00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:34.530
Beep-bup-beep
Piipapii papipo, piipapii

108
00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.580
No No No No No norenai

109
00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.660
No, no, no, no, no, not feelin' it

110
00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:43.820
kobiritsuichatte mou odorenai

111
00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.860
I'm all stiff, all outta dances

112
00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:48.100
My head feels so good, 'f I get unlucky again
atama Feel so good, mata Unlucky demo

113
00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:52.200
Cola de fukitobase yowaki o
just gonna blow away the shy with a cola

114
00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:56.280
Hey all you boys & girls! Looking good!
soko no Boys & Girls! omae ii yatsu

115
00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:59.830
Hey all you boys & girls!
soko no Boys & Girls!

116
00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.800
Update failed. I've had enough!
appudeto wa shippai kori gori

117
00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.680
Wasn't it OK 'til yesterday?
kinou made nara seikai?

118
00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:12.010
La la la la la la, run, run, run...
ran ran ran ran ran ran Run Run Run

119
00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.730
"Hiding yet?"
mou ii kai?

120
00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:18.100
You ready yet, up for a dance
junbi wa douyo odoreru no?

121
00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.470
bukkowareteru kono jidai
in this broken era?

122
00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:24.150
"Come find us!"
mou ii yo!

123
00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:26.500
Spread out from here, drop into the world
koko kara kakusan sekai e Drop

124
00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.900
Let loose on the stage of freedom and liberation
jiyuu to kaihou no Stage e

125
00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.130
Those rising heads're punks!!!!!! No way!!!
wakiagaru atama ga Punk!!!!!! No way!!!

126
00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.080
Sick of waitin', goof off and dance
matenaiyo fuzaketa Dance

127
00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.060
Dopamine spilling over
afuredasu dopamin

128
00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.300
The lonely singing in unity
kodoku ga tsudoi utau koushin

129
00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.400
Bip-bip-bip-bup-bup-bup-bup-bupping
pipipi papapapapatteru

130
00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.360
Can't can't can't count me out yet
mada mada mada horobinai

131
00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.810
There's some stranger waving me over
shiranai dareka ga temaneki da

132
00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:46.550
Smilin' so wide that it can't be real
uso mitai ni waratteru
